  },
  {
    question: 'Cheap VPNs legit?',
    answer: '<p>Yes, but you\'re paying 2-3 years upfront. That\'s the trade-off.</p>'
  },
  {
    question: 'Employer see my VPN use?',
    answer: '<p>Personal VPN on personal device: no. Company device: maybe. Corporate VPN: yes.</p>'
  },
  {
    question: 'Freelancers need to pay?',
    answer: '<p>Absolutely. Client data on public WiFi? Get the $3/month protection.</p>'
  }
